(version 1)

# The maker's stem and calyx (bare gold on both sides) and the front ground plane cut round the few front links are
# artwork. This rule stops DRC from flagging the art for being art; everything electrical (pads, tracks, vias and
# the ground copper against other nets) is still checked in full.
(rule "Fine gaps inside the artwork"
  (condition "A.Type == 'Graphic' && B.Type == 'Graphic'")
  (constraint clearance (min 0.01mm)))
